# ECLOUD per-environment secrets (P10-A; SECURITY_ARCHITECTURE.md §9, DEPLOYMENT_ARCHITECTURE.md §4.2).
# One line per secret file: <name>|<min length>|<kind>|<consumers>|<rotation runbook section>
#   kind token    = 48 random bytes, base64url (64 chars)  -> app key material / HMAC keys
#   kind password = 40 random [A-Za-z0-9] characters       -> URL- and config-safe passwords
# Files are written by generate.sh to var/secrets/<env>/<name> (dir 0700, files 0600) and are
# mounted by Compose `secrets:` as /run/secrets/<name>. Names only here - never values (D-033).
internal_api_token|32|token|api, portal, freeradius (X-Internal-Token)|R1
mfa_encryption_key|32|token|api (TOTP secret envelope)|R4
data_encryption_key|32|token|api (NAS/UAM secret_ref envelope)|R5
voucher_pepper|32|token|api (voucher code HMAC)|R6
portal_state_secret|32|token|portal (flow + CSRF token HMAC)|R3
postgres_password|32|password|postgres superuser (bootstrap only)|R7
ecloud_app_password|32|password|api, portal (RLS role ecloud_app)|R7
ecloud_platform_password|32|password|worker, migrate (BYPASSRLS role ecloud_platform)|R7
radius_sql_password|32|password|freeradius (INSERT-only role ecloud_radius)|R7
radius_status_secret|32|password|freeradius Status-Server healthcheck client|R2
redis_password|32|password|redis requirepass; api, portal, worker|R7
